      "widgets_values": [
        "**Prompt upsampler.** Type a short request in **Request**; the upsampler (Generate Text) turns it into the full prompt shown in the preview.\n\nKeep the aspect ratio in **Upsampler input** the same as in **Resolution Selector** (1:1, 4:3, 3:4, 3:2, 2:3, 16:9 or 9:16).\n\nSet **Use prompt upsampler** to false to send the request to the model as it is."
